{"title":"OSDev (foreign language)","slug":"OSDev_foreign_language","html":"<h2 id=\"french\">French</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://a.michelizza.free.fr/pmwiki.php?n=TutoOS.TutoOS\" rel=\"noopener\">http://a.michelizza.free.fr/pmwiki.php?n=TutoOS.TutoOS</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://sos.enix.org/fr/SOSDownload\" rel=\"noopener\">http://sos.enix.org/fr/SOSDownload</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"german\">German</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.lowlevel.eu/\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.lowlevel.eu/</a> (Forum: <a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://forum.lowlevel.eu/\" rel=\"noopener\">1</a>; IRC: irc.euirc.net, #lost)</li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.henkessoft.de/\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.henkessoft.de/</a> (Forum: <a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.c-plusplus.de/forum/f62\" rel=\"noopener\">2</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"japanese\">Japanese</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://wiki.osdev.info/\" rel=\"noopener\">http://wiki.osdev.info/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"polish\">Polish</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://osdev.pl/\" rel=\"noopener\">http://osdev.pl/</a> - Site about Open Source, doesn't seem to be really about OSDev.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"portuguese\">Portuguese</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.dei.isep.ipp.pt/~orlando/so2/\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.dei.isep.ipp.pt/~orlando/so2/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"russian\">Russian</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://osrc.info\" rel=\"noopener\">http://osrc.info</a></li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"french","text":"French","level":2},{"id":"german","text":"German","level":2},{"id":"japanese","text":"Japanese","level":2},{"id":"polish","text":"Polish","level":2},{"id":"portuguese","text":"Portuguese","level":2},{"id":"russian","text":"Russian","level":2}],"categories":["Resources"],"rating":null,"flags":[],"words":35,"summary":"","updated":"2024-02-01","authors":["Predefine"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/OSDev_(foreign